[Host] It means a competitor or a player — a person who competes.

31
00:03:22,283 --> 00:03:29,843
[Slow] 車の修理やロボットなど、いろいろな仕事の種目があります。

32
00:03:30,644 --> 00:03:35,491
[Host] There are events for many kinds of jobs, such as car repair and robots.

33
00:03:36,092 --> 00:03:38,395
